WEBVTT

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.650
Who's going to break into the wooden statue?

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.340
Fang Shiyu

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:35.620
Who's going to be in charge today?

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:45.480
My teacher, Chen Shidi

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:51.420
Fang Shiyu, you haven't finished your studies for three years

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.000
You're good at breaking into the wooden statue

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.020
Do you know what the consequences are?

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:57.260
I know

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:00.000
If you can't break into it, you have to start over

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.000
If you are in a hurry, then you should go back quickly.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.400
I have decided to leave the mountain.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.450
Please forgive me.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:07.660
Do you know why this alley is called Muran alley?

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.260
I know.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.060
The one who is in charge of the alley,

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.210
although he is the brother of Shishu Bo,

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:14.610
he will never show mercy.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:15.730
His heart is like a stone.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.610
He is known as Muran alley.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.650
Fang Shiyi.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.650
If there is a death wound, who will you blame?

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:22.450
Just blame yourself for being uneducated.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.080
Okay.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.650
- Chenguang. - Yes.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:38.450
Be careful.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:31.730
What the fuck?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:02.720
Hey, hey!

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:18.980
Thank you, Master.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:43.990
Master, Fang Shiyu is in deep trouble.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:45.630
He killed Chen Guang, a disciple of his.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.110
Master, please investigate.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:50.090
Is he a disciple of Feng Dao Ge?

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.790
Yes.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.970
Fang Shiyu wouldn't do such a thing.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.970
Brother Zhi Shan, you don't trust us.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:10.500
Junior, we can't stay here any longer, let's go back to Wudang.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:14.100
We are from the Wudang Sect, we can't learn anything from Shaolin Temple.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.830
Let's go.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:22.390
Junior, you did the right thing.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:24.910
Senior Bai Mei, you already know what happened just now.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:30.000
Zhi Shan is suspicious, Shaolin Temple is not a place for us to stay.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:33.560
In the future, it is inevitable to fight against the Shaolin Sect.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.800
I will deal with Zhi Shan.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.080
I am especially worried about Fang Shiyu.

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.120
Yes.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.260
Fang Shiyu has been drawn by his mother since he was a child.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.770
He cleans his whole body with medicinal wine.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.770
He has trained into a copper-skinned iron bone.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:51.090
Just now, the knife of Fifth Junior Brother hit him.

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:54.620
I'm afraid it won't hurt his body.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.840
When Brother Feng meets him in the future,

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.280
when they fight,

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.000
he must use a skill to lure him to fly.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.670
This is the only place that can stimulate his body.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.370
He must do his best.

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:06.290
I got it.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.730
What are you doing?

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:15.810
What do you want to do?

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:18.330
What do you want to do?

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:22.800
Li Er Shu owes Lei Dao a lot of money.

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:27.840
I'm the one who owes Lei Dao money.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:28.890
I'm the one who owes Lei Dao money.

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.000
I'm the one who owes Lei Dao money.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.950
I don't have your money, so you're putting us in a tight spot.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.490
You call yourself a drunkard, but you don't even know me.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:52.570
Fang Shiyu!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.470
He Dayou, you can't call yourself a kicker.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:19.140
Pick up the other's paintings.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:10:00.000
The Shaolin Temple will be open for at least three years.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.990
How did you get out so fast?

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:32.850
Come on, cheers.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:36.500
The wine is good, it's okay.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.330
Come on, cheers.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.330
The beef soup is great.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.330
The beef soup is great.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.330
Come on, cheers.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.330
Cheers.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.220
Come on.

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:50.220
The wine is good, it's okay.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:52.220
Come on, cheers.

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:54.220
Lei is still following in his footsteps.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.430
Come on, let's have a drink.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:11:00.000
I don't believe that the hero of the world

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.510
All the heroes have died

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:07.930
No, but Lei laohu knows that you entered Shaolin Temple

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:11.750
He has been practicing plum blossom makeup

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.750
There have already been two tyrants who have died under plum blossom makeup

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:18.670
Plum blossom makeup?

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.770
Yes, plum blossom makeup

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.940
All the buildings are buried under the plum blossom makeup

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:26.830
When they fell down

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.320
There was a hero that I buried with my own hands

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.410
all over the place.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:33.580
Make-up?

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:36.630
If you haven't practiced,

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.380
you'd better leave this place as soon as possible.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.410
If that's the case,

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.140
I don't need to break into Murong Xiang.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:44.680
It won't be hard for you to find me if you don't have any make-up on.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.660
If you don't have any make-up on,

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:48.110
you will definitely suffer losses

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.370
if you fight with Lei Lao Bu.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:50.510
Don't worry.

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:52.500
Stay at my house for one night.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.910
Tomorrow morning,

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:56.280
you and I will also have our make-up on.

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:58.120
We will have to practice for a few more days

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.000
before we can find him.

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:21.000
Mao Shiyu is back!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.320
Why didn't you come find me?

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:26.120
He's with He Dayou, I don't know what he's up to.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:07.650
Huh?

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.360
That old man!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:39.510
Hey!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:01.250
Thank you.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:30.610
Hmm.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.820
- Hey!

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:00.580
I did it.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.030
Go!

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.370
The world is hanging on the head. The thicker, the more the wind blows.

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:51.250
Boom! Boom! Boom!

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.630
The golden flag, the small board.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:11.340
One more time! One more time! One more time!

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:13.340
One more time! One more time!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.620
"Tung Sha"

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:38.470
"Tieri Ya"

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:40.460
Boss Fu, today we can't change hands

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:42.960
Let's borrow some money

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.730
Borrow money?

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.100
Don't joke around, there's no rich son in the casino

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.370
If you can't change hands

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.550
There's a pawn shop on the street

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:54.760
What kind of people are we?

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:56.900
You don't even have the guts to sell

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:00.000
What kind of people are you?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.230
I'm the leader of the Jinlun Hall.

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:06.100
If Huang Li loses, I'll lose too.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.050
Hu Xiaoting, say that again.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.390
If you can't lose, don't bet.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.950
Others are afraid of you and Jinlun Hall. I'm not afraid.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:12.950
You guys...

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:28.750
Don't fight!

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.000
Don't fight!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.000
We didn't offend you.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:30.000
I'm not going to pay. Listen up! Your father is a useless man.

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:34.250
The head is fatal, the wound is 2 inches long.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:38.180
It is reported that the money was collected and it hit the wall.

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.050
Nonsense, it is full of bruises.

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:41.650
Did he hit the wall himself?

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:43.850
He lost his hand and was taken back by his family.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:47.480
He committed suicide and was not able to save his life.

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.380
Gu Weiqian, you want to rebel.

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:51.090
You want to protect Jinluntang.

00:21:51.090 --> 00:21:52.620
I will find them to settle the score myself.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:14.950
He's here!

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:34.280
Lv Jiatou, there's an ambush.

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:34.710
Who?

00:22:34.710 --> 00:22:35.710
Hu Huixian.

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:29.600
He's the son of the court.

00:23:46.570 --> 00:23:49.930
there are tens of thousands of workers in the base of Jinlintang.

00:23:49.930 --> 00:23:52.260
There are Wudang masters as their instructors.

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:54.310
Even the government is worried about them.

00:23:54.310 --> 00:23:55.880
They can't be bothered.

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:57.930
We...

00:23:57.930 --> 00:23:59.540
Get out! All of you get out!

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:05.660
I do want to mess with you.

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.280
You did mess with me once.

00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:17.190
Let's see what you can do.

00:24:17.190 --> 00:24:21.670
I still want to go.

00:24:21.670 --> 00:24:23.490
As long as I have one breath left,

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:24.410
I will go.

00:24:26.320 --> 00:24:27.080
It's him again.

00:24:27.080 --> 00:24:27.930
Hurry up.

00:24:27.930 --> 00:24:30.000
Hurry up.

00:24:30.350 --> 00:24:43.120
Go to hell!

00:25:14.040 --> 00:25:15.760
I'm not going to let you get away with this!

00:25:15.760 --> 00:25:19.750
I'm not going to let you get away with this!

00:26:30.670 --> 00:26:34.520
You still want to go?

00:26:34.520 --> 00:26:35.380
I still want to go!

00:26:35.380 --> 00:26:38.200
You know you can't beat him, so what are you going to do?

00:26:38.200 --> 00:26:39.250
I'm going to fight with all my might!

00:27:09.180 --> 00:27:11.130
- How much? - I won't sell it.

00:27:11.130 --> 00:27:12.370
Why would you sell it?

00:27:12.370 --> 00:27:14.730
The people in Jinlun Hall are not lawful.

00:27:14.730 --> 00:27:17.570
No one in Guangzhou dare to provoke them.

00:27:17.570 --> 00:27:19.890
Only you dare to fight with them.

00:27:19.890 --> 00:27:21.650
You are a hero.

00:27:21.650 --> 00:27:24.010
I don't want you to die.

00:27:24.010 --> 00:27:25.280
I won't sell it.

00:27:30.120 --> 00:27:31.160
Let's have a drink.

00:27:31.160 --> 00:27:37.780
Sure, let's have a drink.

00:27:37.780 --> 00:27:39.660
Come on, come on, come on.

00:27:39.660 --> 00:27:41.630
Let's go, let's go.

00:27:41.630 --> 00:27:43.830
Where are you going upstairs?

00:27:43.830 --> 00:27:45.920
Let's go upstairs.

00:27:45.920 --> 00:27:47.640
Let's go upstairs and have a look.

00:27:47.640 --> 00:27:51.180
Hey, look at this.

00:27:51.180 --> 00:27:52.060
It's really beautiful.

00:27:52.060 --> 00:27:53.340
Come in and have a look.

00:27:53.340 --> 00:27:54.690
It's not bad.

00:27:54.690 --> 00:27:55.730
What is it?

00:27:55.730 --> 00:27:57.980
It's pretty good.

00:27:57.980 --> 00:28:00.000
It's very valuable.

00:28:01.240 --> 00:28:04.240
I think it's good. It's a good way to get out of the country.

00:28:30.250 --> 00:28:31.810
Hey, someone's fighting.

00:28:31.810 --> 00:28:34.590
Hu Weixian is such a good man.

00:28:34.590 --> 00:28:37.860
He's the only one who dares to provoke the people in Jinluntang.

00:28:37.860 --> 00:28:40.100
It's a pity that he can't beat them.

00:28:40.100 --> 00:28:42.870
I think this time, he won't be able to survive.

00:28:42.870 --> 00:28:48.500
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey...

00:29:30.120 --> 00:29:32.720
Let's go.

00:29:45.390 --> 00:29:46.790
I saved you, how are you going to beat me?

00:29:46.790 --> 00:29:48.550
I'm looking for someone to kill, who wants you to do this?

00:29:48.550 --> 00:29:50.770
I don't think you're looking for someone to kill.

00:29:50.770 --> 00:29:53.220
You're just sending someone to be beaten to death.

00:29:55.290 --> 00:29:56.900
Who are you?

00:29:56.900 --> 00:29:58.640
He's Fang Shiyi.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:03.040
You are the Fang Shiyu who killed Lei Laohu at Meihua Manor.

00:30:03.040 --> 00:30:05.700
I heard about your story.

00:30:05.700 --> 00:30:07.620
If you want to take revenge, I can help you.

00:30:07.620 --> 00:30:09.060
No, I want to do it myself.

00:30:09.060 --> 00:30:09.860
Okay.

00:30:09.860 --> 00:30:12.410
With your current martial arts skills, you can't.

00:30:12.410 --> 00:30:16.810
You have to go to Shaolin Temple and practice hard.

00:30:16.810 --> 00:30:18.050
I'm afraid you won't be able to bear this kind of pain.

00:30:18.050 --> 00:30:22.980
You can bear it. I can bear it, too.

00:30:34.760 --> 00:30:35.220
Ha!

00:31:56.750 --> 00:32:00.000
How dare you talk nonsense when you want to do business?

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:01.660
This is the business of the country's workers.

00:32:01.660 --> 00:32:03.660
You always buy things for nothing.

00:32:05.860 --> 00:32:07.780
Is there anyone else you don't like?

00:32:07.780 --> 00:32:10.490
Hurry and kneel in front of the hall and admit your mistakes.

00:32:10.490 --> 00:32:15.340
Otherwise, it would be a waste of time to kill you.

00:32:15.340 --> 00:32:17.600
Run! Stop running!

00:32:31.120 --> 00:32:32.280
Do you still recognize me?

00:32:32.280 --> 00:32:34.370
Hu Weijian, you still dare to come back?

00:32:34.370 --> 00:32:35.590
What are you doing back here?

00:32:35.590 --> 00:32:36.700
We're going to fight in the chicken room.

00:32:44.920 --> 00:32:45.880
Let go of me!

00:33:04.760 --> 00:33:11.040
I don't know.

00:33:52.400 --> 00:33:53.440
I bought it, I bought it, I bought it

00:33:53.440 --> 00:33:59.640
My friend

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:03.450
I don't know where I've seen him before.

00:34:03.450 --> 00:34:09.540
Take your time to think about it.

00:34:32.680 --> 00:34:42.100
The more you look at this friend, the more you feel that you're familiar with him.

00:34:42.100 --> 00:34:43.950
Haven't you thought about it yet?

00:35:05.560 --> 00:35:12.560
Eight heads, nine pairs.

00:35:19.570 --> 00:35:22.370
I remember it now, he's the guy from three years ago.

00:35:22.370 --> 00:35:24.260
The guy who helped Wu Hui Qian.

00:35:24.260 --> 00:35:26.490
That's right, Instructor Lu is a good memory.

00:35:26.490 --> 00:35:27.490
What do you want?

00:35:27.490 --> 00:35:28.730
Nothing.

00:35:30.030 --> 00:35:32.680
I'm here to compensate you two for making a bet

00:35:32.680 --> 00:35:36.120
so that Hu Huiqian will have time to tear down your Jinluntang's chicken coop

00:35:36.120 --> 00:35:37.270
Good boy

00:35:57.800 --> 00:35:59.640
Don't fight

00:36:00.160 --> 00:36:01.640
Your boss is here.

00:36:01.640 --> 00:36:04.200
I think Hu Huiqian has almost taken down the Jifang.

00:36:04.200 --> 00:36:05.480
Instructor! Instructor!

00:36:05.480 --> 00:36:08.000
Hu Huiqian has destroyed the Jifang and the Jilun Hall.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:09.840
I'm sorry. See you later.

00:36:09.840 --> 00:36:11.380
Don't try to run away, kid!

00:36:17.900 --> 00:36:23.380
This is a waste of time.

00:36:23.380 --> 00:36:25.800
You'd better go to Yuanxiang House to find Hu Huiqian.

00:36:30.280 --> 00:36:33.840
Our capital is small, if the two teachers come...

00:36:33.840 --> 00:36:37.180
Don't worry, I've taken care of seven houses today.

00:36:37.180 --> 00:36:39.870
I'll wait for Niu Huajiao and Lv Yingbu here.

00:36:39.870 --> 00:36:43.280
As soon as they show up, I'll take them out.

00:36:43.280 --> 00:36:47.510
If anything goes wrong, I'll take care of it.

00:36:47.510 --> 00:36:50.190
Mr. Hu Ying, if you can take care of these two people,

00:36:50.190 --> 00:36:52.230
that's a big help to Guangzhou.

00:36:52.230 --> 00:36:53.640
You have to be careful.

00:36:53.640 --> 00:36:56.080
If Hu Guiqian can't take care of them,

00:36:56.080 --> 00:36:58.890
if you say those words to their ears,

00:36:58.890 --> 00:37:00.000
your tea house

00:37:00.410 --> 00:37:01.530
Then it's all gone.

00:37:02.210 --> 00:37:04.470
Go and tell the subordinates of Jilun Hall

00:37:04.470 --> 00:37:08.790
to wait for me in Jilun Hall.

00:37:08.790 --> 00:37:21.570
Everyone, let's go.

00:37:32.880 --> 00:37:37.010
Niu Huajiao, Lv Yingbu, it's time to settle our accounts.

00:37:37.010 --> 00:37:40.140
If we settle it, you still owe us a life.

00:37:40.140 --> 00:37:47.320
Come on, hurry up.

00:39:00.220 --> 00:39:00.770
Yes

00:39:30.190 --> 00:39:52.330
All of you are here, please listen to what I have to say.

00:39:52.330 --> 00:40:00.000
I will teach Lv Ying Bu and a small group of Jifang's people.

00:40:01.120 --> 00:40:04.640
You always break the law and get angry at people's grievances.

00:40:04.640 --> 00:40:06.510
It's your own fault.

00:40:06.510 --> 00:40:08.830
If you keep spreading it, you can't make a fool of yourself again.

00:40:08.830 --> 00:40:11.530
Hu Weixian, you shouldn't have smashed the signboard of Qilun Hall.

00:40:11.530 --> 00:40:13.840
The three characters of Qilun Hall are unspeakable.

00:40:13.840 --> 00:40:15.720
It's because of Niu Huajiao's harm.

00:40:15.720 --> 00:40:19.160
Smashing this old signboard is for your own good.

00:40:19.160 --> 00:40:22.740
Do you know what others think of you?

00:40:22.740 --> 00:40:27.650
From now on, if you break the law again,

00:40:27.650 --> 00:40:29.760
I'll beat you every time I see you.

00:40:30.380 --> 00:40:34.400
They both have a grudge against me for killing my father

00:40:34.400 --> 00:40:37.360
They are the disciples of the Wudang Sect

00:40:37.360 --> 00:40:39.280
The Wudang Sect has been colluding with Qingting since the beginning of the Feng Dao

00:40:39.280 --> 00:40:42.210
They have been slandering and harming the people

00:40:42.210 --> 00:40:44.070
We must not let them off

00:40:53.840 --> 00:40:58.480
Let's go

00:41:15.360 --> 00:41:17.260
- You can't just leave. - I have to leave.

00:41:17.260 --> 00:41:20.720
Young Master, there are many things that we need to do.

00:41:20.720 --> 00:41:23.600
I'll go find Fang Zhiyu first, then I'll go find Hong Xiguan.

00:41:23.600 --> 00:41:28.560
I heard that the government is hiring experts to arrest Hong Xiguan.

00:41:28.560 --> 00:41:29.830
That's why I have to go find him.

00:41:31.470 --> 00:41:31.990
I don't know.

00:42:01.340 --> 00:42:02.020
Thank you.

00:42:56.490 --> 00:43:00.000
There are signs everywhere. They say you're going to be arrested.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:02.000
I really don't understand what you guys are doing.

00:43:02.000 --> 00:43:04.050
Who is different as the emperor?

00:43:04.050 --> 00:43:05.350
Different.

00:43:05.350 --> 00:43:06.520
Okay, okay.

00:43:06.520 --> 00:43:09.320
Different.

00:43:09.320 --> 00:43:11.320
Don't be so loud, okay?

00:43:11.320 --> 00:43:17.270
No, hurry up and come out.

00:43:17.270 --> 00:43:21.270
The people from Tidu Yamen are here again.

00:43:21.270 --> 00:43:23.670
I don't know which one should be unlucky.

00:43:23.670 --> 00:43:30.000
Hongying, a guest is calling you.

00:43:43.210 --> 00:43:45.830
Why hasn't Tong Ying come out yet?

00:43:45.830 --> 00:43:48.280
Tong Ying, we have a guest.

00:43:48.280 --> 00:43:50.550
Don't lose your temper.

00:43:50.550 --> 00:44:00.000
Do you know who we are?

00:44:01.530 --> 00:44:03.330
Aren't you just a representative of the capital?

00:44:03.330 --> 00:44:05.750
How do you know?

00:44:05.750 --> 00:44:09.520
I've seen people from the capital

00:44:09.520 --> 00:44:11.980
What's your name?

00:44:11.980 --> 00:44:15.670
I'd like to ask you if you're a representative of a high-ranking official

00:44:17.670 --> 00:44:20.200
It's not a big deal

00:44:20.200 --> 00:44:22.730
We'll compensate you if you break anything

00:44:24.930 --> 00:44:30.000
Here

00:44:30.220 --> 00:44:34.420
Don't be so polite, it's none of your business!

00:44:34.420 --> 00:44:38.020
You don't have to be so angry, you can have as many as you want!

00:44:38.020 --> 00:44:40.420
That's too much!

00:44:47.830 --> 00:44:53.410
Come on!

00:44:53.410 --> 00:44:55.510
Long Xiguan, kill them all!

00:44:55.510 --> 00:44:56.910
Kill them all!

00:44:57.710 --> 00:44:59.030
Kill them all!

00:45:04.120 --> 00:45:23.890
Did you catch any suspicious people?

00:45:23.890 --> 00:45:25.630
I caught one, he didn't even hit me.

00:45:25.630 --> 00:45:27.330
He even used a stick to get me and I was dead.

00:45:27.330 --> 00:45:30.000
Lord Lei, I think

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:34.270
You don't have the guts to hide in the city.

00:45:46.590 --> 00:45:52.300
Go after him.

00:45:52.460 --> 00:45:55.150
I said he's in the city. You don't believe me?

00:45:55.310 --> 00:45:57.640
Sir, we'll change the notice tomorrow and raise the reward.

00:45:57.800 --> 00:45:58.610
- We'll go tonight. - Yes.

00:46:02.620 --> 00:46:19.620
The red one is for the red.

00:46:19.620 --> 00:46:29.510
The blue one is for the red.

00:46:32.780 --> 00:46:33.240
No.

00:47:08.890 --> 00:47:10.050
The soup isn't enough.

00:47:10.050 --> 00:47:11.810
- How much do you want? - Three points.

00:47:16.130 --> 00:47:23.770
The Qing Ting Eagle Puppets can chase after them.

00:47:23.770 --> 00:47:25.820
You must be careful.

00:47:25.820 --> 00:47:29.000
Brother Hong, you came to the city to kill a lot of the Eagle Puppets.

00:47:29.000 --> 00:47:30.000
You scared them to death.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:33.670
I don't want to see it, it's really nice

00:47:33.670 --> 00:47:36.080
How many hawks can I deal with alone?

00:47:36.080 --> 00:47:38.830
There are not enough people here

00:47:38.830 --> 00:47:41.270
We have to contact the heroes from all over the country

00:47:41.270 --> 00:47:43.890
One ship ten, ten ship hundred

00:47:43.890 --> 00:47:47.730
Keep spreading to restore the Ming Dynasty

00:47:47.730 --> 00:47:50.540
Before entering the city, I met with Hu Huiqian

00:47:50.540 --> 00:47:54.060
In a few days, someone will come down from Shaolin Temple

00:47:54.060 --> 00:47:57.520
We should not stay here for a long time

00:47:57.520 --> 00:48:00.000
Leave each other tomorrow morning

00:48:00.990 --> 00:48:02.920
- Be careful. - Yes.

00:48:30.090 --> 00:48:33.090
Come on, come on, come on.

00:48:33.090 --> 00:48:44.570
How dare you!

00:48:44.570 --> 00:48:47.040
Don't move. Who are you?

00:48:47.040 --> 00:48:49.040
I'm not going to change my name or my surname.

00:48:49.040 --> 00:48:51.030
I'm the young master, Tong Qianjing.

00:48:51.030 --> 00:48:53.100
Take him.

00:49:19.100 --> 00:49:20.600
They must have come to find the Red Star Temple.

00:49:20.600 --> 00:49:23.590
We can only find the Red Star Temple by following them secretly.

00:49:42.600 --> 00:49:43.900
You don't want to get in trouble, but you do want to get in trouble.

00:49:44.470 --> 00:49:45.190
What are you talking about?

00:49:45.350 --> 00:49:46.910
The people from Shaolin Temple want to be like you.

00:49:47.030 --> 00:49:47.830
They will leave as soon as they see you.

00:49:47.950 --> 00:49:48.940
What else can they do?

00:49:49.710 --> 00:49:50.930
I don't think you can do anything big.

00:49:53.140 --> 00:49:54.640
You have to wait until you see Hong Da Ge.

00:49:55.830 --> 00:49:56.690
Now you are making trouble.

00:49:56.890 --> 00:49:59.210
I don't know if I can see Hong Da Ge at the set time.

00:50:10.430 --> 00:50:13.060
Brother Hong, Senior Tong and Senior Nian should be here today

00:50:13.060 --> 00:50:17.130
Yes, I'll go and welcome them

00:50:17.130 --> 00:50:22.370
I can't hide in the room because of the reward notice

00:50:45.870 --> 00:50:51.540
Brother Hu, you actually hit a wooden statue.

00:50:51.540 --> 00:50:55.730
I actually came out of it.

00:51:17.850 --> 00:51:19.270
Mr. Tung, you want to leave?

00:53:00.350 --> 00:53:03.330
Oh, oh, oh.

00:55:08.990 --> 00:55:12.250
If 56 people go, you're the only one who can escape.

00:55:12.250 --> 00:55:15.120
What are you doing here?

00:55:15.120 --> 00:55:16.440
Guards.

00:55:16.440 --> 00:55:18.040
Yes.

00:55:18.040 --> 00:55:19.880
Call the whole province.

00:55:19.880 --> 00:55:23.310
Ask Wu Dang and Emei to be the masters.

00:55:23.310 --> 00:55:26.950
I will burn Shaolin Temple to the ground.

00:56:12.760 --> 00:56:15.990
Feng Daode set up Shaolin Temple in Gaojin

00:56:15.990 --> 00:56:17.530
As long as we have a breath of air

00:56:17.530 --> 00:56:19.510
We still have to keep going

00:56:19.510 --> 00:56:20.670
You're right

00:56:20.670 --> 00:56:22.590
We'll disperse temporarily

00:56:22.590 --> 00:56:24.670
Brother Fang will go back to Zhaoqing

00:56:24.670 --> 00:56:27.820
We'll make a base at Qingyun Temple

00:56:27.820 --> 00:56:30.000
Eagle and dog are close

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:32.890
He can hide in the red boat

00:56:32.890 --> 00:56:39.000
Ding Fu in the opera troupe will be in charge of contacting him

00:57:13.500 --> 00:57:16.190
I didn't expect our play to be more and more popular.

00:57:16.190 --> 00:57:17.330
Everywhere in the countryside,

00:57:17.330 --> 00:57:19.290
when they hear the red boat, they all run away.

00:57:19.290 --> 00:57:24.000
Junior Li, I think you can really change your career.

00:57:24.000 --> 00:57:29.950
Wait, why isn't there any movement on the boat?

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:34.840
Yes, we are left behind to pack up. Other people should have come back earlier.

00:59:27.520 --> 00:59:29.220
How many people are on the red boat?

00:59:30.440 --> 00:59:31.780
Are there any Shaolin disciples?

00:59:31.780 --> 00:59:34.060
There are twenty-six in total, eight under the Shaolin sect.

00:59:34.060 --> 00:59:36.330
The one in charge is called Ding Fu, he sings in five voices.

00:59:36.330 --> 00:59:37.700
He's already dead.

00:59:37.700 --> 00:59:39.600
All the others have to be punished.

00:59:39.600 --> 00:59:40.890
Only one woman left.

00:59:40.890 --> 00:59:43.150
Woman? Who is she?

00:59:43.150 --> 00:59:44.010
Her name is Li Cui Ping.

00:59:44.010 --> 00:59:45.670
It's said that she's a good friend of Hu Hui Qian.

00:59:45.670 --> 00:59:46.960
She fled from Yanhe.

00:59:46.960 --> 00:59:49.200
I've already sent Li's men to follow her.

00:59:49.200 --> 00:59:50.460
Take care of Ding Fu.

00:59:50.460 --> 00:59:56.950
Yes, sir.

01:00:01.760 --> 01:00:04.960
Why don't you kneel down before the Governor?

01:00:11.210 --> 01:00:13.610
Ding Fu, you are the son of Shaolin?

01:00:13.610 --> 01:00:14.930
Yes.

01:00:14.930 --> 01:00:17.710
Shaolin Temple told me to burn it down.

01:00:17.710 --> 01:00:19.220
The Shaolin son also died.

01:00:19.220 --> 01:00:20.600
Seven, seven, eight, eight.

01:00:20.600 --> 01:00:22.250
How many are left to die?

01:00:23.640 --> 01:00:25.740
I don't think it's a long life.

01:00:25.740 --> 01:00:27.240
The Shaolin son can die.

01:00:27.240 --> 01:00:28.510
The Han can't die.

01:00:28.510 --> 01:00:30.000
Ding Fu, do you know

01:00:30.250 --> 01:00:33.640
Fang Shiyu, Hu Huiqian, Hong Xiguan

01:00:33.640 --> 01:00:35.860
How much is the reward for the three of them?

01:00:35.860 --> 01:00:37.970
I know, it's a good news

01:00:37.970 --> 01:00:42.030
And there are thousands of taels of silver in the future

01:00:42.030 --> 01:00:47.630
Dingfu, a thousand taels of silver is enough for you to enjoy

01:00:47.630 --> 01:00:52.020
If you sell it yourself, why don't you enjoy it?

01:00:52.020 --> 01:00:59.700
Bring me the torch

01:01:43.400 --> 01:01:46.420
Where are Hong Xiguan, Fang Zhiyu and Hu Huixian hiding?

01:01:46.420 --> 01:01:47.620
Tell me!

01:01:47.620 --> 01:01:54.860
I say, they are in the middle of the people.

01:01:58.790 --> 01:01:59.670
Hurry up!

01:02:02.080 --> 01:02:30.000
Oh, hey, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

01:02:34.570 --> 01:02:37.650
Look at that.

01:03:06.170 --> 01:03:12.190
You two, wait! You two are...

01:03:12.280 --> 01:03:13.800
If you don't change your name, you don't change your surname.

01:03:13.880 --> 01:03:16.580
We're Shaolin disciples.

01:03:16.830 --> 01:03:18.390
You two, it's not safe here.

01:03:18.470 --> 01:03:19.470
The eagles will still come.

01:03:19.550 --> 01:03:21.050
Hurry and go to the town in front.

01:03:21.130 --> 01:03:22.100
Who are you?

01:03:22.180 --> 01:03:23.060
I'm Li Cui Ping.

01:03:23.140 --> 01:03:24.220
Brother Hu Hui Qian?

01:03:24.300 --> 01:03:25.780
That's my friend.

01:03:25.860 --> 01:03:27.300
It's been a long time since I've seen you.

01:03:27.380 --> 01:03:29.660
Gao Jin Zhong brought his soldiers to burn down Shaolin Temple.

01:03:30.280 --> 01:03:33.160
They've all left. I don't know where to look for them.

01:03:33.230 --> 01:03:33.840
Let's go.

01:03:49.970 --> 01:03:52.080
Lord Lei, the Li brothers have followed Li Cui Ping.

01:03:52.180 --> 01:03:53.900
Li Cui Ping has taken them as his own people.

01:03:54.060 --> 01:03:55.760
Good. Follow their signs.

01:03:55.920 --> 01:03:59.120
Before you see the Chief, don't alert him.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:00.420
Okay.

01:04:51.600 --> 01:04:54.170
Miss Lin, this alley has been walked just now.

01:04:54.170 --> 01:04:56.880
Yes, there are people following, so there are a few circles.

01:05:04.410 --> 01:05:08.260
Miss Li, it's been two days. When will we be able to see Brother Hu and the others?

01:05:08.260 --> 01:05:11.110
That's right. Why are you always taking us around?

01:05:11.110 --> 01:05:15.800
Don't worry. We'll be able to see them once the sky is clear.

01:05:15.800 --> 01:05:19.780
- We should go now. - Okay.

01:06:23.360 --> 01:06:24.520
I've got news.

01:06:31.080 --> 01:06:34.440
We will be able to see Hong Xiguan and the others before dark today.

01:06:34.440 --> 01:06:35.440
Let's hurry and leave.

01:06:35.440 --> 01:06:52.860
There's no one here.

01:06:52.860 --> 01:06:54.610
I'll be there as soon as I call.

01:06:54.610 --> 01:06:57.170
Brother Hong.

01:06:57.170 --> 01:06:59.860
The Tidu Yamen of Guangdong, Qianzong.

01:07:00.410 --> 01:07:05.660
Li Erhuan wants to see you.

01:07:30.090 --> 01:07:32.220
Gao Jinzhong and his men will follow us.

01:07:32.220 --> 01:07:36.750
Be careful, don't go into this grave.

01:07:36.750 --> 01:07:39.240
Yesterday, you sent out a message.

01:07:39.240 --> 01:07:40.990
We were prepared for it.

01:07:40.990 --> 01:07:42.600
When Gao Jinzhong comes,

01:07:42.600 --> 01:07:44.920
it's his fate if he doesn't die.

01:07:44.920 --> 01:07:50.400
Gong Yanfu died miserably.

01:07:50.400 --> 01:07:51.670
We have to get some people to accompany him.

01:07:51.670 --> 01:07:54.290
I don't know where you are.

01:07:54.290 --> 01:07:55.800
You can't imagine

01:07:55.800 --> 01:07:57.910
that we are in Qingyun Valley, which has been abandoned for many years.

01:08:45.840 --> 01:08:47.320
There are many robbers down there.

01:10:12.000 --> 01:10:13.120
Master.

01:10:13.120 --> 01:10:13.930
Hurry and set out.

01:10:13.930 --> 01:10:17.200
I know where the missing "Yu Nie" is hiding.

01:10:17.200 --> 01:10:18.050
Where?

01:10:18.050 --> 01:10:20.130
Hurry and go. We'll talk on the way.

01:10:20.130 --> 01:10:20.880
Master.

01:10:20.880 --> 01:10:23.450
This way, please.

01:10:27.990 --> 01:10:30.000
Let me change into my uniform.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:40.090
- Yes. - You're right.

01:10:40.090 --> 01:10:42.210
They can kill people at the ancient tomb.

01:10:42.210 --> 01:10:44.020
They won't be far away.

01:10:44.020 --> 01:10:47.440
Just now, I saw two disciples of Shaolin

01:10:47.440 --> 01:10:50.570
buying 200-300 jin of rice at a rice shop.

01:10:50.570 --> 01:10:56.820
I can tell that there are at least ten of them.

01:11:06.040 --> 01:11:08.840
Lei Dapeng, get the men ready.

01:11:08.840 --> 01:11:09.570
Yes.

01:11:36.720 --> 01:11:39.170
Junior Hong, you bought rice and came back.

01:11:39.170 --> 01:11:40.710
- Did anyone follow you? - No.

01:11:40.710 --> 01:11:42.370
There were several hawks on the way.

01:11:42.370 --> 01:11:55.270
They just walked by without looking at us.

01:11:55.270 --> 01:11:57.210
It's too quiet outside.

01:11:57.210 --> 01:11:58.980
I always feel that something is going on.

01:11:58.980 --> 01:12:00.000
This Qingyun Temple

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:01.350
It's been wasted for many years.

01:12:01.510 --> 01:12:02.960
I'm a local of Zhaoqing.

01:12:03.120 --> 01:12:04.310
That's why I know this place.

01:12:04.470 --> 01:12:07.450
No one else will know.

01:12:07.610 --> 01:12:09.950
Brother Chen, Brother Qi.

01:12:10.110 --> 01:12:11.990
You go out and see if there's any movement.

01:12:12.150 --> 01:12:12.550
Yes.

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:00.680
Go!

01:13:33.130 --> 01:13:35.920
Brother Chen, Brother Chen, what's wrong with you?

01:13:35.920 --> 01:13:40.940
Brother Chen, our master, Feng Daozi and Gao Jinzhong

01:13:40.940 --> 01:13:43.100
have surrounded this place with their men.

01:13:43.100 --> 01:13:43.970
Where is Brother Qi?

01:13:43.970 --> 01:13:45.970
He is in the middle with me.

01:13:45.970 --> 01:13:49.270
He is still fighting with the enemies outside.

01:13:49.270 --> 01:13:52.960
Good, Shaolin Temple has been burned down.

01:13:53.790 --> 01:13:57.270
Master Zhi Shan has also been killed by the old thief, Bai Mei.

01:13:57.270 --> 01:14:00.000
Today, it is the blood of all our Shaolin disciples.

01:14:00.030 --> 01:14:02.880
Let's go out and fight, you can fight one by one.

01:14:02.880 --> 01:14:04.710
I just hope that after this fight,

01:14:04.710 --> 01:14:08.860
there are still a few people left to continue Shaolin.

01:14:08.860 --> 01:14:11.610
If not, everyone will be in trouble.

01:14:11.610 --> 01:14:14.810
The loyalty and righteous spirit of our Shaolin disciples

01:14:14.810 --> 01:14:17.370
will always be in the world.

01:14:17.370 --> 01:14:18.370
Brother Hong, don't worry.

01:14:18.370 --> 01:14:20.290
The Shaolin disciples have their own ancestors,

01:14:20.290 --> 01:14:21.170
their own age,

01:14:21.170 --> 01:14:24.170
but there is no one who is afraid of death.

01:14:24.170 --> 01:14:24.990
Okay, brothers.

01:14:24.990 --> 01:14:25.910
Let's go.

01:14:25.910 --> 01:14:29.830
Today is the day of the marriage.

01:14:34.890 --> 01:14:39.890
Brother Chen, I'll kill all of you.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:00.420
Thank you.

01:15:49.580 --> 01:15:54.610
You have no choice but to surrender and protect your lives.

01:15:54.730 --> 01:15:58.170
Why don't you ask my brothers?

01:15:58.290 --> 01:16:00.000
Fang Shiyu, Nian Ruixin.

01:16:00.280 --> 01:16:03.730
Dong Qianjun, Hu Huiqian and Li Cuiping.

01:16:03.730 --> 01:16:08.450
They are the best young men in Shaolin.

01:16:08.450 --> 01:16:10.010
Just because of us,

01:16:10.010 --> 01:16:12.120
you are so weak,

01:16:12.120 --> 01:16:13.850
you don't want to leave alive.

01:16:13.850 --> 01:16:17.940
You have been working hard for Shaolin.

01:16:17.940 --> 01:16:19.300
You don't need to say more.

01:16:19.300 --> 01:16:21.390
Fine, you are stubborn.

01:16:21.390 --> 01:16:24.020
No, let's go.

01:16:24.710 --> 01:16:27.290
Spread out.

01:16:27.290 --> 01:16:28.590
Go out from all sides.

01:16:28.590 --> 01:16:30.000
Go out one by one.

01:16:32.110 --> 01:16:34.170
I'll be the captain. Give me the sword. - Yes.

01:16:34.170 --> 01:16:37.110
Go! Go! Go!

01:19:30.830 --> 01:19:31.510
No!

01:21:01.920 --> 01:21:02.470
Yes, sir!

01:22:02.200 --> 01:22:04.100
Hey, hey, hey.

01:22:32.010 --> 01:22:32.920
E-haw!

01:24:01.790 --> 01:24:06.880
If you help me to explode, I didn't plan to leave this place alive this year.

01:24:06.880 --> 01:24:23.560
I just need to kill a few more eagles, and that's it.

01:24:23.560 --> 01:24:27.780
I'll wait for you over there.

01:24:37.560 --> 01:24:38.040
Yeah!

01:25:08.760 --> 01:25:17.740
We'll see you next time.

01:26:33.420 --> 01:26:33.880
Uh-huh.

01:27:12.570 --> 01:27:20.800
At the same time, I can still count my moves.

01:27:20.800 --> 01:27:26.020
Now, this sword is stuck in my stomach.

01:27:26.020 --> 01:27:30.000
Oh, I know.

01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:32.150
I'd better leave now.
